# Frontend / backoffice UI

- Tokens in `src/app/globals.css`: zinc neutrals, accent `#e85d04` / `#f97316`, Geist.
- Support **light / dark / system** via icon-only `ThemeToggle` (tooltip on hover; `class="dark"` when resolved dark).
- Ban SPEI navy/purple/gold and copying styles from `docs/13_*.html`.
- Prefer tool UI density; avoid marketing hero layouts in backoffice.
- Detail: `docs/engineering/DESIGN_TOKENS.md`.
